      "writtenOn": "2015-10-16T19:12:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think I worded this poorly. In this case, the token simply can\u0027t be validated against the v2 API (keystone uses v3 internally, essentially). I\u0027ll clarify.\n\nAlthough, I wonder if there are other calls in v2 that it wouldn\u0027t make sense to call? GET :5000/v2.0/tenants for example. I have no idea what the response to that would be if some tenants are outside the default domain. Exclude them? Raise 401?",
